  "details": "<p>According to an inscription of the Neo-Babylonian king Nabonidus, Eulma\u0161 was founded by Nar\u0101m-S\u00een of Agade and rebuilt/renovated by the Kassite king Kurigalzu I and the Assyrian kings Esarhaddon and Ashurbanipal.\u00a0<span>Nabonidus claims to have rebuilt the temple on the original\u00a0Sardonic Period foundations.</span></p>",
